  { icon: 'calendar', title: 'Start with the payroll date', text: 'Tell us when salaries are due and how much of the upcoming payroll you need to cover.' },
  { icon: 'list', title: 'Confirm the information needed', text: 'Ask which payroll records, company documents and cash-flow details Incash needs to review your enquiry.' },
